  "title": "Bangladesh's Sheikh Hasina's planned return puts Dhaka-Delhi tensions and India in a bind",
  "summary": "Bangladesh's ex-Prime Minister Sheikh Hasina has expressed her desire to return on December 16, seeking a passport and flight to Dhaka, while facing extradition and potential arrest. The government insists on her extradition and warns of legal repercussions. Meanwhile, India's High Commissioner to Bangladesh confirmed that her extradition request is under examination, highlighting ongoing legal processes. India maintains the extradition is well-structured, while acknowledging the government's role in supporting the process.",
